<title>HUNGARY: Soproni '96 pre-tax profit HUF 869.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Soproni '96 pre-tax profit HUF 869.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 1996     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit		882.9	vs    288.7</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  869.6	vs    193.2</p>
<p>    Net sales		     5,729.0	vs  5,673.3</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   344.1	vs    199.6</p>
<p>    Direct costs of sales     3,623.6	vs  3,602.3</p>
<p>    Indirect costs of sales     914.6	vs  1,715.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    604.3	vs    425.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   71.2 loss vs     89.5 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	     53.0	vs     40.1</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure	124.2	vs    129.6</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income     57.9 profit vs    6.0 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - Soproni Sorgyar Rt is a brewery. The figures are not consolidated and the 1996 figures are not audited.  </p>
<p>			     Soproni's consolidated figures for 1996</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 1996</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    808.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		732.8</p>
<p>    Net sales		  14,768.3</p>
<p>    Other revenue		 238.3</p>
<p>    Material costs	    2,258.3</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures    915.0</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  569.4</p>
<p>    Other costs		   927.1	 vs     458.4</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	  625.2	 vs     425.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income	 85.0 loss  vs	89.5 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	   58.7	 vs	40.1</p>
<p>     Financial expend.	  143.7	 vs     129.6</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    9.1 profit vs	6.0 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue     80.2	 vs	34.7</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expend.     71.0	 vs	40.7</p>
<p>    Taxation			  -	   vs	22.0</p>
<p>The figures were prepared according to Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
